{"title":"1983 AHSME Problems/Problem 20","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_20\">Problem 20</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AHSME_Problems/Problem_20&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 20\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/2/8128c75673900289920480e1eb3781900098fa4e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\tan{\\alpha}$\" width=\"40\" height=\"11\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/b/a/8baac0a7e12ff8e3800df67a8752433da6b81499.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\tan{\\beta}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"40\" height=\"16\" /> are the roots of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/7/6/d76aa07fb71cc6d5163e7989f27ab6f10a717a15.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2 - px + q = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"123\" height=\"18\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/5/4/b542ea6fd0016ffacfa8b93f0988f39353e13317.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\cot{\\alpha}$\" width=\"38\" height=\"11\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/5/84519e5769eb0d47ef20b33d0262e4e71c4dda86.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\cot{\\beta}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"40\" height=\"18\" />\nare the roots of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/6/0/06080418215b64924a3909c8e595795259af8a7e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2 - rx + s = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"122\" height=\"16\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/8/8/c889d12451d321614e219737373586e45b71a141.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$rs$\" width=\"16\" height=\"8\" /> is necessarily \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/1/8/51889d2d40836fb9b6a6c4ab8e4b79ca4e8ddf1a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)} \\ pq \\qquad  \\textbf{(B)} \\ \\frac{1}{pq} \\qquad  \\textbf{(C)} \\ \\frac{p}{q^2} \\qquad  \\textbf{(D)}\\ \\frac{q}{p^2}\\qquad \\textbf{(E)}\\ \\frac{p}{q}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -16px\" width=\"396\" height=\"40\" />    \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AHSME_Problems/Problem_20&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>By Vieta's Formulae, we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/6/2/7627cc4ef2ae837c81eec995cf5eddbd989bc869.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\tan(\\alpha)\\tan(\\beta)=q$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"139\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/5/e/65e2eae3c15283e8d174f65d56b8f9df2fc7fcf0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\cot(\\alpha)\\cot(\\beta)=s$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"135\" height=\"18\" />. Recalling that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/4/2/3425969f9855703df6efef0b0348472b59cba421.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\cot\\theta=\\frac{1}{\\tan\\theta}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"101\" height=\"37\" />, we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/3/1/b3117ce5ebe71ef22657982442e62f9cde1dcd83.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{\\tan(\\alpha)\\tan(\\beta)}=\\frac{1}{q}=s$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"180\" height=\"41\" />. \n</p><p>Also by Vieta's Formulae, we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/e/8/1e88edae3fd5fb09383c36b7f78903a3bb968f59.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\tan(\\alpha)+\\tan(\\beta)=p$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"159\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/a/3/ea39dc9d3cffc0b8f371af07b56944cf3ec3c4e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\cot(\\alpha)+\\cot(\\beta)=r$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"154\" height=\"18\" />, and again using <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/4/2/3425969f9855703df6efef0b0348472b59cba421.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\cot\\theta=\\frac{1}{\\tan\\theta}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"101\" height=\"37\" />, we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/b/b/3bbc4a07a96ef687cd67fd3173461ccd2e6642fd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\tan(\\alpha)+\\tan(\\beta)=r(\\tan(\\alpha)\\tan(\\beta))$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"278\" height=\"18\" />. Using <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/6/2/7627cc4ef2ae837c81eec995cf5eddbd989bc869.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\tan(\\alpha)\\tan(\\beta)=q$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"139\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/e/8/1e88edae3fd5fb09383c36b7f78903a3bb968f59.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\tan(\\alpha)+\\tan(\\beta)=p$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"159\" height=\"18\" />, we therefore deduce that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/1/5/d15ddf3f4d581ca93c1dcb9db830d43cedc8b5c3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r=\\frac{p}{q}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -16px\" width=\"44\" height=\"36\" />, which yields <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/a/e/6ae6ac62d874b5de78d6b3d5b4fdd175e7ced6fe.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$rs = \\frac{1}{q}\\cdot\\frac{p}{q}=\\frac{p}{q^2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -16px\" width=\"123\" height=\"40\" />.\n</p><p>Thus, the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/b/f/ebf4b99e5f1d26d21217abb2207e6f4070b10095.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(C)} \\ \\frac{p}{q^2}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -21px\" width=\"66\" height=\"47\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AHSME_Problems/Problem_20&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AHSME\" title=\"1983 AHSME\">1983 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1983 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1983 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1983\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AHSME_Problems/Problem_19\" title=\"1983 AHSME Problems/Problem 19\">Problem 19</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AHSME_Problems/Problem_21\" title=\"1983 AHSME Problems/Problem 21\">Problem 21</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1983 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1983 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1983 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1983 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1983 AHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1983 AHSME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1983 AHSME Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AHSME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1983 AHSME Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AHSME_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1983 AHSME Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AHSME_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1983 AHSME Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AHSME_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"1983 AHSME Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AHSME_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"1983 AHSME Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AHSME_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"1983 AHSME Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AHSME_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"1983 AHSME Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AHSME_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"1983 AHSME Problems/Problem 15\">15</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AHSME_Problems/Problem_16\" title=\"1983 AHSME Problems/Problem 16\">16</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AHSME_Problems/Problem_17\" title=\"1983 AHSME Problems/Problem 17\">17</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AHSME_Problems/Problem_18\" title=\"1983 AHSME Problems/Problem 18\">18</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AHSME_Problems/Problem_19\" title=\"1983 AHSME Problems/Problem 19\">19</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">20</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AHSME_Problems/Problem_21\" title=\"1983 AHSME Problems/Problem 21\">21</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AHSME_Problems/Problem_22\" title=\"1983 AHSME Problems/Problem 22\">22</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AHSME_Problems/Problem_23\" title=\"1983 AHSME Problems/Problem 23\">23</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AHSME_Problems/Problem_24\" title=\"1983 AHSME Problems/Problem 24\">24</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AHSME_Problems/Problem_25\" title=\"1983 AHSME Problems/Problem 25\">25</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AHSME_Problems/Problem_26\" title=\"1983 AHSME Problems/Problem 26\">26</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AHSME_Problems/Problem_27\" title=\"1983 AHSME Problems/Problem 27\">27</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AHSME_Problems/Problem_28\" title=\"1983 AHSME Problems/Problem 28\">28</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AHSME_Problems/Problem_29\" title=\"1983 AHSME Problems/Problem 29\">29</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AHSME_Problems/Problem_30\" title=\"1983 AHSME Problems/Problem 30\">30</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AHSME_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"AHSME Problems and Solutions\"> All AHSME Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<div class=\"print\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;width:100%;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">\n<div>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:AMC_Logo.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/d/d1/AMC_Logo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"97\" height=\"84\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex-grow:1;text-align:right\">\n<p>These problems are copyrighted &#169; by the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.maa.org\">Mathematical Association of America</a>. \n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017174058\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.038 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.058 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 173/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 2494/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 152/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: